      <title>Bisons Compete in Split-Squad Weekend at Boston University and Vanderbilt</title>
      <link>https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/2/14/womens-track-and-field-bisons-compete-in-split-squad-weekendat-boston-university-and-vanderbilt.aspx</link>
      <description>NASHVILLE, Tenn. – Lipscomb Track &amp;amp; Field split squads over the weekend of Feb. 13–14, competing at the BU David Hemery Valentine Invitational in Boston, Mass., and the Vanderbilt Music City Challenge in Nashville, Tenn. The Bisons turned in strong performances across both meets, highlighted by a program record, event wins, and solid depth across sprints, distance, and field events.</description>
